          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabila ya mfalume kumala kugomba, kpwatuluka sauti kula mlunguni ichiamba, “Ee mfalume Nebukadineza, phundza ujumbe huno kukuhusu! Uwe si mtawala tsona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Undazolwa uphiye kure na anadamu nawe undaishi na nyama a tsakani. Undarya nyasi dza ngʼombe kpwa miaka sabaa hadi umanye kukala iye Ariye Dzulu anatawala falume zosi za anadamu, na nkumupha utawala mutu amlondaye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phapho hipho neno riro kuhusu ye Nebukadineza ratimizwa. Wazolwa kahi ya anadamu, na achirya nyasi dza ngʼombe. Walwamiswa ni manena hadi malalaikage gachikala mare dza nyoya za kozi na kombeze zichikala dza za nyama wa mapha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
